import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'storm':('The dispel that stopped at nothing',
  'A level fifty priest stands near the west edge of a lit arena with three vampire bats to its east, full mana, and considers Dispel Undead. The LOS-dispel beam walk has no arrival break: it runs past the bats to the maximum range and exits through the excessive-distance guard, discarding everything it counted, and the launcher returns its initial minus one instead of zero. The dispel is valued at minus fifteen - the leaked minus one minus the spell cost. The correction breaks the walk at the target like a ball, takes path damage for bolts and beams only, and returns zero when nothing survived: the blast scan finally runs and values the bats at five hundred thirty-four.'),
 'control':('Control: the holy orb ball',
  'The same priest considers Orb of Draining, a ball, whose walk already breaks at its target. It is valued identically at five hundred forty before and after the correction, and the complete log is byte-identical: the fix changes only the LOS-dispel walk and the launcher leak.'),}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/losdispel-326 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag in ('GEOMETRY ','RATING ','OUTCOME '):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[tag.split()[0].lower()]=match[1].strip() if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The dispel that stopped at nothing</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native LOS-dispel valuations</p><h1>The dispel that stopped at nothing</h1><p>The Borg values its area-of-sight attacks - the dispel prayers and staff activations - through a beam walk with the dispel convention of radius ten. That walk had no arrival break: it ran past its target to the maximum range and exited through the excessive-distance guard, discarding everything it had counted; the blast scan that values the effect over every monster in sight ran only by accident, when the walk happened to break at the cave edge first. In straight open lines the dispel valued at the launcher leaked minus one, minus the spell cost.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">Maneuver value</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the control establishes</h2><p>The holy orb ball, whose walk already breaks at its target, is valued identically before and after with byte-identical logs: the correction changes only the LOS-dispel walk and the launcher leak, not the bolt, beam or ball machinery.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Priest level fifty, depth thirty, seed one thousand, lit constructed arena, every prayer book carried, wisdom maximized, full mana, three awake vampire bats east of the priest near the west edge so that every beam walk runs to the maximum range rather than the cave edge. The measurement calls the public maneuver chooser with borg_simulate set. This isolates the rad-ten walk and the launcher leak, not full autonomous play. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/326">issue326</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);let r=d.rating||'';let m=r.match(/dispel=(-?\\d+)/)||r.match(/orb=(-?\\d+)/);p.querySelector('.num').textContent='Maneuver value: '+(m?m[1]:'n/a');p.querySelector('.state').textContent=d.outcome||'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='storm'?'The original values the dispel at -15 - the leaked -1 minus the spell cost, the blast discarded; the correction values the bats at 534.':'The ball was never broken: 540 either way, byte for byte.';}select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
